# Playtest: jump game v1.2 (game-developer release `v1.2`, source rev 74ba904c973dacc63235eee878dc806893f6a562)

## How it was played
- Build: `index.html` taken from the assembled delivery (`ht-role delivery`), which is game-developer `main` 74ba904c973d, the revision producer says matches release v1.2 / `jump-game-v1.2.zip`.
- **Limitation:** I cannot read game-developer's releases (only producer's are visible to me), so I did NOT unzip `jump-game-v1.2.zip` itself; "index.html at zip root" and that the zip equals this revision are unverified by me. Producer/game-developer should confirm.
- Played in headless Chromium 156 (Playwright 1.64) at a 1000x500 viewport via `file://.../index.html` (no server), with real keyboard Space presses. No human with eyes/hands was involved: "feel" notes are from state sampling plus screenshots, not a person.
- Scripts: `playtest/tools/play.py`; log `playtest/evidence/play-log.txt`; screenshots `playtest/evidence/01..07-*.png`.

